[{"id":"1431410662614388739","date":1630109870000,"rawContent":"CW \/\/ Sexual assault \n\n2 years ago, HKers held a #MeToo #ProtestToo rally to raise awareness of incidents where police sexually assaulted citizens, and to show support to victims. Sexual violence has long been a taboo subject- talking about it in the open was a big step forward.","userId":1305211665777074176,"media":null,"username":"NiaoCollective","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":1.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":1,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":2,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":1.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1431411715485409285","date":1630110121000,"rawContent":"The fact that the rally was branded as #ProtestToo instead of straight up #MeToo actually already reflects how touchy subjects women's rights and sexual violence are in the city...\n\nSource: TG (Aug 2019) https:\/\/t.co\/UKpebOVyK1","userId":1305211665777074176,"media":["https:\/\/pbs.twimg.com\/media\/E91klUjXsAIfHwJ?format=jpg&name=orig","https:\/\/pbs.twimg.com\/media\/E91k-MdXIAMuVhj?format=jpg&name=orig"],"username":"NiaoCollective","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":2.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":1,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":3,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":2.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1431413588879683584","date":1630110568000,"rawContent":"A lot of the doodles for the #MeToo #ProtestToo rally reflected a sense of helplessness. Under normal circumstances, the law was suppose to punish those who inflict sexual violence. But in HK, the law was the one responsible. There is no one to turn to. \n\nSource: TG (Aug 2019) https:\/\/t.co\/Rfe2wPaL0K","userId":1305211665777074176,"media":["https:\/\/pbs.twimg.com\/media\/E91mNRrXMAMrSwB?format=jpg&name=orig","https:\/\/pbs.twimg.com\/media\/E91mec4XMAM-3BF?format=jpg&name=orig"],"username":"NiaoCollective","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":3.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":1,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":4,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":3.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1431417472729681924","date":1630111494000,"rawContent":"And there was a lot of sexual violence, a lot of injustices. Below is a selection of stories victims of the police shared around the time of the #ProtestToo #MeToo rally. Warning - pretty graphic description of sexual assault.  \n\nSource: TG (Aug 2019) https:\/\/t.co\/pPlEnzNKRw","userId":1305211665777074176,"media":["https:\/\/pbs.twimg.com\/media\/E91ohOWWEAIsmN8?format=jpg&name=orig","https:\/\/pbs.twimg.com\/media\/E91ollFWEAUCW5q?format=jpg&name=orig","https:\/\/pbs.twimg.com\/media\/E91opykWQAQcSRN?format=jpg&name=orig","https:\/\/pbs.twimg.com\/media\/E91owMyXoAgrNZW?format=jpg&name=orig"],"username":"NiaoCollective","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":4.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":1,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":5,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":4.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1431759976784093184","date":1630193153000,"rawContent":"Thread on the #MeToo #ProtestToo rally 2 years ago, and how it shifted the conversation around sexual assault:\n\nhttps:\/\/t.co\/sR9SpTGAhC","userId":1305211665777074176,"media":null,"username":"NiaoCollective","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":5.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter